{"id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","zh":"原始弯曲","en":"initial deflection","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"文中描述钢轨在分析前已有的弯曲几何状态。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"在无缝线路稳定性分析中，指钢轨原先存在的弯曲几何状态，用于考察既有轨形对线路稳定性的影响。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","zh":"原始弯曲","en":"initial deflection","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H29c6b2b4fd3051db76e8","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 陈宪麦等（2015）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D21253c3099e67e7e35d2","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"原始弯曲"},{"id":"Dab1ecb79582442430a03","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"initial deflection"}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sdc3594ef75bdd7f7c366","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"With the methods of site investigation, testing and calculation analysis, useful discussions of rail wear, Sanzhe, rail breaking and initial deflection, parameters of fastener and rail joint bolt torque, service state and geometric parameters of ballast bed, cold damage, track irregularity, are proposed.","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S7da49049888362783e66","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用现场调研、测试和计算分析等研究方法,对滨洲线的钢轨磨耗、三折、断轨和原始弯曲,扣件参数及接头螺栓扭矩,道床状态参数和几何参数,线路冻害和轨道不平顺等线路状态进行深入分析,总结滨洲线轨道状态之特征和变化规律,并提出养护维修之对策。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S0a81ff3089f442a03e47","source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"1.4 钢轨原始弯曲钢轨原始弯曲是由诸多随机因素造成的,是影响无缝线路稳定性的重要因素 [10]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C6bf0d99a74181ffd5b32","targe